<http://www.essepuntato.it/2008/12/pattern#Block> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "\nIn particular, elements following this pattern can contain text and other elements compliant with the patterns `po:Inline`, `po:Atom`, `po:Milestones` and `po:Popup`. \n\nFurthermore, it is a requirement that block elements are contained only by container and popup elements.\n    "@en .
