<http://www.essepuntato.it/2008/12/pattern#Block> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An element that organises the document content as a sequence of nestable elements and text nodes."@en .
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2008/12/pattern#Block> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n        :my-paragraph a po:Block ;\n                po:isContainedBy :my-section ;\n                po:contains :my-span .\n        " .
